+
+        0.99 x 3.1062 ps = 3.0751 ps,
+
+    which is the paper's number to four figures, with exactly the standard
+    0.99 safety factor.  The paper is self-consistent; run the cavity with
+    n = 31 to reproduce its mesh.  Running n = 32 puts dt above the limit and
+    plain Yee diverges -- which is what happened to a 2000-step run before
